WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.361
Operations controls how the site runs.

00:00:03.411 --> 00:00:08.876
The recipient lists decide who receives Quote and Contact notifications,

00:00:08.926 --> 00:00:11.634
and who receives application emails.

00:00:11.684 --> 00:00:14.775
Each list supports one to five addresses.

00:00:14.825 --> 00:00:20.367
Unlike content drafts, Operations changes take effect when you save them.
